@startuml
actor Analyst
participant "Existing Map Workspace / Copilot" as UI
participant "Vector Analysis API" as API
participant "VectorSpatialAnalysisRepository" as Repo
database "Local PostgREST / PostGIS" as DB
Analyst -> UI: Select persisted sources, operation, parameters
opt Deterministic AI preparation
 UI -> UI: Existing tool registry validates prepareVectorAnalysis
 UI -> UI: Match unchanged saved binding; resolve DB UUIDs
end
UI -> API: Estimate request + current user session
API -> Repo: Validate, request budget, same-origin
Repo -> DB: Authenticated bounded RPC (preview)
DB -> DB: Current profile + project assignment\nlayer revisions + UUID features\ncounts, extent and concurrency limits
DB --> UI: Server-derived estimate
Analyst -> UI: Execute
UI -> API: Same validated request
Repo -> DB: Reauthorize and recheck revisions
DB -> DB: Bounded PostGIS operation\nvalidate every output component
DB --> Repo: Geometry + units + provenance
Repo --> UI: Fully validated transient result
UI -> UI: Existing Leaflet read-only overlay
opt Explicit human copy and save
 Analyst -> UI: Copy to new editable layer
 UI -> UI: Existing MapRecipe reducer / Undo
 Analyst -> UI: Save to authorized project + confirm
 UI -> DB: Existing Phase 15 persistence API / revision checks
 DB -> DB: Atomic save + immutable revision evidence
 DB --> UI: Committed new layer/revision
end
note over DB: No source mutation during analysis.\nNo external database or paid provider.
@enduml
